			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920102915-kqmazhq",
				"updated": "20260920102915"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "設定"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "編輯器"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "拼寫檢查"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 中啟用此功能。拼寫錯誤會以波浪線標記。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920102915-2zycdok",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920102915-2zycdok",
				"updated": "20260920102915"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "桌面端：在帶有波浪線的單字上按右鍵，於思源選單中選擇更正建議，也可將正確的單字加入詞典。桌面端請使用一般右鍵，無需按住 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Shift"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920102915-yi3fmra",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920102915-yi3fmra",
				"updated": "20260920102915"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "瀏覽器端：請在瀏覽器設定中啟用拼寫檢查並選擇檢查語言。在 Chrome 中，按住 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Shift"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 並在帶有波浪線的單字上按右鍵，即可使用瀏覽器原生的更正選單。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920102915-3dmr3wm",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920102915-3dmr3wm",
				"updated": "20260920102915"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "拼寫檢查的觸發時機取決於執行環境。開啟文件後即使游標已恢復，也可能需要點選正文並稍候才會顯示波浪線。"
				}
			]
		}
	]
